</div></p><p>Table 1 shows that there were more males than females across all three nationality groups. The majority of those immigrating long-term in YE December 2025 were working age (aged between 16 and 64 years), including:</p>
<ul>
  <li><p>87% were non-EU+ nationals</p></li>
  <li><p>86% were British nationals</p></li>
  <li><p>82% were EU+ nationals</p></li>
</ul>
