      </div>
  
    <h4 class="print--hide padding-top--0 margin-top--0 font-size--h6 clear-left"><span role="text">Download this chart <span class="visuallyhidden">Figure 11: Among people emigrating, Indian was the most common non-EU+ nationality</span></span></h4>

