      <p>Please see chart notes 1 to 4 in Section 11: <a href="https://www.ons.gov.uk/peoplepopulationandcommunity/populationandmigration/internationalmigration/bulletins/longterminternationalmigrationprovisional/yearendingdecember2025#quality-methods-and-data-sources">Quality, methods and data sources</a>.</p>
  
      </div>
  
    <h4 class="print--hide padding-top--0 margin-top--0 font-size--h6 clear-left"><span role="text">Download this chart <span class="visuallyhidden">Figure 12: Those with status on the EUSS continue to account for the majority of total EU+ emigration</span></span></h4>

