      <div id="notes-d2504b4f" class="notes-holder-js">
  
      <h5 class="flush--third--bottom js-notes-title font-size--16 padding-top--0">Notes:</h5>
      <p>Please see chart notes 1 to 4 and 8 to 10 in <a href="https://www.ons.gov.uk/peoplepopulationandcommunity/populationandmigration/internationalmigration/bulletins/longterminternationalmigrationprovisional/yearendingdecember2025#quality-methods-and-data-sources">Section 11: Quality, methods and data sources</a>.</p>
  
      </div>
  
    <h4 class="print--hide padding-top--0 margin-top--0 font-size--h6 clear-left"><span role="text">Download this chart <span class="visuallyhidden">Figure 13: Among people emigrating, Romanian was the most common EU+ nationality</span></span></h4>

